      { heading: '4. Capacitor filter and ratings', content: 'For a full-wave capacitor-input supply with small ripple, triangular-ripple approximation gives deltaVpp approximately Iload/(2 fline C). Higher load current or lower capacitance increases ripple. Account for transformer regulation, diode drops, capacitor voltage rating, inrush current, ESR heating, and diode surge current; ideal formulas are first-order estimates.' }
